{"name":"-57-L7-2","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Corridor","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Saga_AVG_Dusk","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Life is filled with partings, and one must come to accept these partings."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After many such partings, you thought your heart had long since been hardened like steel."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But then how come Lily could accept your departure so readily in the forest last time, while you could not help feeling sad about it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Argh—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You groan and scratch at your scalp again."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You still want to find a chance to properly say your goodbyes to Lily..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, she was busy with practice the last few times you went looking for her and couldn't spare any time to speak to you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No matter what, I need to get hold of her today!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Livingroom_a","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Open","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bang! You fling the door open and storm into the room."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lily, I have something to tell you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"